{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Owl Bounce is an exciting arcade game where you control an amazing owl-shaped ball capable of incredible jumps! Immerse yourself in a world of colorful levels, where your goal is to collect juicy apples and avoid obstacles on your path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each jump, you must showcase your agility and reflexes by clicking the mouse or tapping the screen to perform fantastic jumps and overcome various obstacles. You\u2019re not just meant to complete levels; you\u2019ll also develop your skills to achieve the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse levels with unique challenges and traps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful graphics and an engaging soundtrack that create a fun and adventurous atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Owl Bounce is your chance to become a master of jumps and adventures, overcoming temptations at every level. Collect all the apples and show what you\u2019re capable of in this thrilling journey!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724540?t=1749657010","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724540?t=1749657010","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724540/63e15f9ca6206d08d7312a6a8cf4045798ce4748/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749657010","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724540/63e15f9ca6206d08d7312a6a8cf4045798ce4748/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749657010","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Owl Bounce is an exciting arcade game where you control an amazing owl-shaped ball capable of incredible jumps! Immerse yourself in a worl